  "solution_ref": "$p={}_5C_1\\frac14\\left(\\frac34\\right)^4+{}_5C_3\\left(\\frac14\\right)^3\\left(\\frac34\\right)^2+{}_5C_5\\left(\\frac14\\right)^5=\\frac{405+90+1}{4^5}=\\frac{31}{64}$. $128p=62$",
